WEBVTT

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:01.800
You wear a lot of hats.

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.700
And somehow, one thing takes the whole week.

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:06.900
Leaving too little for family.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:08.500
For yourself.

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:09.090
So,

00:00:09.545 --> 00:00:10.215
you pause.

00:00:10.685 --> 00:00:11.845
Write down what matters.

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:14.400
Give each responsibility an hour or two.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:15.850
Draw a box.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.250
Give it a purpose.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:18.800
Add the tasks.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.300
That little plan becomes Spread.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:23.100
Responsibilities.

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:24.400
Hours.

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:25.600
Your week.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:27.150
Your tasks.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.400
Make the hours count.
